<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MAF Bancorp raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MAF Bancorp raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Chicago Corp said Wednesday it raised MAF Bancorp Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>--Chicago Corp also said it increased MAF Bancorp's fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $3.40 from $2.70 to reflect the beneficial effects of the acquisition of NS Bancorp Inc on net interest margins and expectations of continued strong contributions from real estate operations.</p>
<p>--Shares of MAF rose 1-1/4 to 31-1/2 on Nasdaq Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
